      "</div>",
      "<h2 class=\"section__header__title\">",
      "          Aylin Morgan \u2014 AI Foundations Instructor",
      "         </h2>",
      "<p class=\"section__header__desc\">",
      "          Updated July 2026",
      "         </p>",
      "</div>",
      "</div>",
      "<div class=\"section__body InnovationsDetailsBody_ai-content__cjJWX\">",
      "<p>",
      "<strong>",
      "<img alt=\"\" src=\"__NAIC_ASSET__deYUdTsQHyplFuuz5aaUXzMShQSNXgY8kR1G7HTA.jpg__\"/>",
      "</strong>",
      "</p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Aylin supports learners who are building a rigorous foundation in artificial intelligence. Her teaching emphasizes clear definitions, responsible use, and the difference between demonstrations and dependable systems.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Her course work connects conceptual understanding with practical exercises in data preparation, model evaluation, communication, and risk-aware decision making.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Public professional information includes approved certifications, relevant experience, and the courses to which the instructor is assigned.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Open the related course to review audience, difficulty, format, duration, pricing, availability, and enrollment guidance.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Share:",
      "        </p>",
      "<p>",
