      "</div>",
      "<h2 class=\"section__header__title\">",
      "          From AI Foundations to Applied Technology Work",
      "         </h2>",
      "<p class=\"section__header__desc\">",
      "          July 2026",
      "         </p>",
      "</div>",
      "</div>",
      "<div class=\"section__body InnovationsDetailsBody_ai-content__cjJWX\">",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         This public outcome story describes how a graduate used a structured learning pathway to strengthen technical reasoning and practical confidence.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         The learner began with clear foundational concepts, completed guided exercises, and developed a portfolio that communicated both technical work and decision rationale.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         The related course supported progress through defined outcomes, transparent expectations, and practical feedback rather than relying on vague promises.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Outcome stories are published only when explicitly approved for public display. Internal identifiers and sensitive personal information remain excluded.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Prospective learners should treat individual outcomes as examples, not guaranteed employment results.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Share:",
      "         <strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-2537be76-7fff-e875-c491-35c23022cbfe\">",
      "</strong>",
      "</p>",
      "</div>",
