      "<h2 class=\"section__header__title\">",
      "          Access Scholarship",
      "         </h2>",
      "<p class=\"section__header__desc\">",
      "          Valid for the published application period",
      "         </p>",
      "</div>",
      "</div>",
      "<div class=\"section__body InnovationsDetailsBody_ai-content__cjJWX\">",
      "<p>",
      "         The Access Scholarship provides partial course-fee support for eligible learners entering selected foundational programs.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p>",
      "         The public page explains coverage, eligibility, applicable courses, validity dates, and the application process without exposing applicant records.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p>",
      "         A complete application requires an authenticated student workflow, formal application status, ownership controls, and protected document handling.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p>",
      "         Availability and recipient limits are confirmed by the authoritative backend before any award is represented as approved.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p>",
