      "<div class=\"section__body InnovationsDetailsBody_ai-content__cjJWX\">",
      "<p>",
      "<strong>",
      "<img alt=\"\" src=\"__NAIC_ASSET__deYUdTsQHyplFuuz5aaUXzMShQSNXgY8kR1G7HTA.jpg__\"/>",
      "</strong>",
      "</p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         The Legal and Policy Center provides one public entry point for privacy, terms, enrollment and cancellation, cookie preferences, and accessibility information.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Each policy should have an approved owner, version, effective date, and change history.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Public policy links remain available from the footer and relevant course or enrollment contexts.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Where a consent version is recorded, the exact policy version accepted by the user must remain auditable.",
      "        </p>",
