      "</div>",
      "<h2 class=\"section__header__title\">",
      "          Privacy Policy",
      "         </h2>",
      "<p class=\"section__header__desc\">",
      "          Effective July 2026",
      "         </p>",
      "</div>",
      "</div>",
      "<div class=\"section__body InnovationsDetailsBody_ai-content__cjJWX\">",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Nexora Academy processes only the information required for public requests, account identity, enrollment, payments, reviews, notifications, security, and support.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Personal information must not be exposed through public pages, analytics events, browser logs, or unprotected API responses.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Students should be able to understand the purpose, legal basis, retention, and access rules associated with each data category.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Authentication tokens, passwords, one-time codes, payment details, and private application records are never public content.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Consent records should identify the version accepted and the time of acceptance.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Share:",
      "         <strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-2537be76-7fff-e875-c491-35c23022cbfe\">",
      "</strong>",
      "</p>",
      "</div>",
