      "</div>",
      "<h2 class=\"section__header__title\">",
      "          Enrollment and Cancellation Policy",
      "         </h2>",
      "<p class=\"section__header__desc\">",
      "          Effective July 2026",
      "         </p>",
      "</div>",
      "</div>",
      "<div class=\"section__body InnovationsDetailsBody_ai-content__cjJWX\">",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Enrollment begins only after the student selects a valid available cohort and confirms the required consent information.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         A submitted enrollment may require payment before it becomes confirmed. The displayed state must match the authoritative backend state.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Cancellation availability depends on the enrollment status, course timing, and published policy. Completed enrollments cannot be cancelled through the ordinary flow.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         A cancellation does not imply that a refund has been approved. Refund processing follows a separate authoritative payment workflow.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Seat holds, registration deadlines, and capacity must be enforced by the backend rather than only by the interface.",
      "        </p>",
      "<p dir=\"ltr\">",
      "         Share:",
      "         <strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-2537be76-7fff-e875-c491-35c23022cbfe\">",
      "</strong>",
      "</p>",
      "</div>",
